+
+	// Analog repeat pacing: a partly tilted stick repeats slower, down to
+	// about a quarter speed near the tilt threshold, so held-stick value
+	// changes can be walked one step at a time or slammed to the far end.
+	// Digital inputs read as full deflection and keep stock pacing.
+	if (menucmd[i].dpad_mag >= JOYAXISRANGE/2 && menucmd[i].dpad_mag < JOYAXISRANGE)
